      "writtenOn": "2022-12-15T23:58:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Where is builder.go currently calling into tidy.go?  I see references to `config.TidyReduceCFlags`, but I haven\u0027t found anything to tidy.go.",
      "parentUuid": "f3b3b0d3_cce3c034",
      "revId": "42e2323e1d89e19a9245a19cd81b823a5dbac894",
